WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.176 --> 00:00:02.350
Do you have a favourite salon?

00:00:02.689 --> 00:00:03.950
Ask them for a member card.

00:00:04.315 --> 00:00:07.387
Every visit earns you a ticket, and when you have enough tickets,

00:00:07.337 --> 00:00:08.270
you get a discount.

00:00:08.526 --> 00:00:11.150
Invite your friends, and you get extra tickets too.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.684
The salon activates your card, and emails it to you.

00:00:14.997 --> 00:00:18.844
To see it, tap your name at the top, and choose Loyalty cards.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:22.580
Each card has its own QR code, the tickets you've collected,

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.084
and how many more you need for your discount.

00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:30.533
Every time you visit the salon, open your card, and show the QR code to the staff.

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:33.573
They scan it, and you get one ticket straight away.

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:37.653
Tap Open card, to see your progress ring, and your ticket history.

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:39.104
Want more tickets?

00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:41.664
Your card has a section, Invite a friend.

00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:44.944
Tap Copy my invite link, and send it to your friends.

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:49.143
When a friend books through your link, and visits the salon for the first time,

00:00:49.093 --> 00:00:51.104
you automatically get two extra tickets.

00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:54.702
When you have enough tickets, tell the staff at your next visit,

00:00:54.652 --> 00:00:56.401
and you get your discount right away.

00:00:56.669 --> 00:00:57.921
Now take the quiz below!
